    {
        text = "Add Kirin Tor, Wyrmrest Accord and Knights of the Ebon Blade. Reach Friendly through their introductions, then buy their tabards from Alvareaux upstairs in Northrend Dalaran's Violet Citadel, Cielstrasza atop Wyrmrest Temple, and Mynx at the UNLOCKED Shadow Vault. Equip one PHYSICAL tabard and clear Normal Halls of Lightning; leave, reset and repeat to Exalted before swapping to the next. Use the Northrend Vanguard faction guides if a vendor is phased. Argent Crusade was already counted in the previous step.",
        routes = {{1010}},
        points = {pin(120,45.3,21.6,7,"Normal Halls of Lightning - repeat each equipped Northrend tabard")},
    },
    {
        text = "Add your faction's Alliance Vanguard OR Horde Expedition and its separate Silver Covenant OR Sunreavers reputation. REMOVE championing tabards and clear original Wrath Heroics such as Utgarde Keep or Gundrak, checking the actual bars after kills. Rotate unsaved Heroics after boss kills. For the Covenant/Sunreavers, also complete the Argent Tournament's mounted introduction, Aspirant and Valiant promotions, then its unlocked dailies. These are two distinct faction bars; the five-city Champion title is not required just to earn their reputation.",
        routes = {{1011},{1012},{3676},{3677}},
    },
    {
        text = "Add Sons of Hodir. Start They Took Our Men! with Gretchen Fizzlespark in K3, then finish the Brunnhildar/Thorim chain through Mending Fences. Loot Slag Covered Metal and finish The Refiner's Fire and A Spark of Hope. Continue until Dun Niffelem is friendly and Lillehoff offers repeatable Relics of Ulduar hand-ins. Buy or farm relics and repeat those hand-ins to Exalted, supplementing with unlocked dailies. Do not buy a large stock before opening the turn-in.",
        routes = {{2083,{[1]=true,[3]=true}}},
    },
    {
        text = "Add The Kalu'ak through its Northrend stories, then three dailies: Utaik's Preparing for the Worst at Kaskala in Borean Tundra, Trapper Mau'i's Planning for the Future at Moa'ki Harbor, Dragonblight, and Anuniaq's The Way to His Heart... at Kamagua, Howling Fjord. The last needs the Kamagua/Scalawag Point pirate introduction. Complete all three after each daily reset until Exalted; there is no dungeon-championing Kalu'ak tabard.",
